OL,3,GNEWSAMan given life sentence for
OL,4,A13-week-old baby murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been sentenced to life
OL,7,Fimprisonment, with a minimum 21-year
OL,8,Fterm, for murdering his girlfriend's
OL,9,F13-week-old baby.
OL,11,FHunter Hodges suffered a "severe direct
OL,12,Fimpact" to the head like that seen in
OL,13,F"a high-speed motorcycle collision or a
OL,14,Fmulti-level fall", a trial at
OL,15,FCanterbury Crown Court previously
OL,16,Fheard.
OL,18,FTyla Wharmby, 24, of Prestedge Avenue
OL,19,Fin Ramsgate, was caring for the baby
OL,20,Fovernight while his partner, Shannon
OL,21,FHodges, slept on 15 July 2022. Wharmby
OL,22,Fis not Hunter's biological father.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
