OL,3,GNEWSAMan given life sentence for
OL,4,A13-week-old baby murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe had pleaded not guilty to murder and
OL,7,Fgrievous bodily harm with intent, but
OL,8,Fwas found guilty of both on 29 October.
OL,9,FHe was sentenced at Canterbury Crown
OL,10,FCourt earlier.
